  ozelFonksiyon: "tarot gelecek sohbeti ba\u015Flat"
  aciklama:
  - "Gelecek i\xE7in \"De\u011Fnek Onlusu\" kart\u0131n\u0131 se\xE7tin.\n\nKap\u0131lar\u0131n\u0131
    kapatt\u0131\u011F\u0131nda, t\xFCm s\u0131k\u0131nt\u0131lar\u0131n\u0131 kap\u0131n\u0131n
    ard\u0131nda b\u0131rakacaks\u0131n. Sorunlar\u0131 k\xF6kl\xFC \u015Fekilde
    \xE7\xF6zmek i\xE7in ciddi giri\u015Fimlerin olaca\u011F\u0131n\u0131 g\xF6r\xFCyorum.
    Kart\u0131n, t\xFCm sorumluluklar\u0131n\u0131 kucaklayarak zirveye varmak i\xE7in
    elinden geleni yapaca\u011F\u0131n\u0131 s\xF6yl\xFCyor {{isim}}. \u015Eimdiye
    kadar ortaya koydu\u011Fun t\xFCm eforun g\xFCzel neticelerini almana ramak kalm\u0131\u015F.
    Ger\xE7ekten s\u0131n\u0131rlar\u0131n\u0131 zorluyorsun ve kendini a\u015F\u0131yorsun.
    \xDCzerinde bir miktar bask\u0131 da hissedece\u011Fini g\xF6r\xFCyorum. Buna
    ald\u0131rmadan ilerleeceksin. Kapasiten her t\xFCrl\xFC stresle ba\u015Fa \xE7\u0131kabilecek
    kadar geni\u015F. Hayata kar\u015F\u0131 direni\u015Fin zaferle sonu\xE7lanacak."
